    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the consistency thing, but i feel like i already eat pretty much the same stuff every day so it shouldn't be that much of a change? i just really want those antioxidants and feel like if i'm taking meds i should be eating as healthy as possible to make up for it. wouldn't the nutrients in the greens actually help my heart health more than the risk of my levels moving a little bit?",
